  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let the median and the mean deviation about the median of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> observation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>170</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>230</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>190</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>210</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></math> be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>170</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>205</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math> respectively. Then the mean deviation about the mean of these <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> observations is:</p>",
